 resources, and will stop at nothing to do it. It all turns into a race against the clock to prevent a disaster where many lives are at stake...","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.6}],"value":8.6,"age":"PG-13"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":760,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}